WEBVTT

00:00:02.810 --> 00:00:05.100
Let's work together, Mao.

00:00:05.900 --> 00:00:07.270
No.

00:00:08.530 --> 00:00:09.610
Why not?

00:00:10.750 --> 00:00:13.240
Because I betrayed you?

00:00:13.630 --> 00:00:15.040
No, that's not why.

00:00:15.040 --> 00:00:17.550
We'll be rich beyond our wildest dreams.

00:00:17.550 --> 00:00:20.570
After how poor we were as kids.

00:00:20.570 --> 00:00:22.490
I don't care about money.

00:00:23.040 --> 00:00:26.730
I don't want to leave this city.

00:00:27.630 --> 00:00:29.290
I like this city!

00:00:29.290 --> 00:00:33.090
And the people I've met here!

00:00:34.800 --> 00:00:35.900
I see.

00:00:36.370 --> 00:00:37.800
In that case...

00:00:38.370 --> 00:00:40.200
I'll destroy them.

00:00:40.200 --> 00:00:44.810
This city... and all your friends!

00:00:46.780 --> 00:00:48.090
Don't.

00:00:48.090 --> 00:00:51.170
I'll have to kill you right here.

00:00:51.170 --> 00:00:53.860
Fine by me. Go for it.

00:00:55.440 --> 00:00:57.570
I don't want to.

00:00:57.570 --> 00:01:00.220
A hitman who doesn't want to kill?

00:01:00.220 --> 00:01:02.400
You're such a coward.

00:01:02.890 --> 00:01:04.870
Let me help you remember

00:01:04.870 --> 00:01:06.040
what it was like!

00:01:08.130 --> 00:01:10.480
Return to your old self!

00:01:14.720 --> 00:01:16.630
Was that aimed at me?

00:01:16.630 --> 00:01:18.760
No, I hit what I meant to!

00:01:35.020 --> 00:01:38.350
You can't escape from me, Mao.

00:01:40.550 --> 00:01:44.520
<b>#12  Walk-Off Home Run</b>

00:01:51.610 --> 00:01:52.720
Damn it.

00:01:55.170 --> 00:01:56.630
Missed call from 
Banba Zenji

00:01:58.590 --> 00:02:01.070
He's still the only one I can turn to.

00:02:06.670 --> 00:02:08.580
Hello, Lin-chan?

00:02:08.580 --> 00:02:11.560
What are you doing out here?

00:02:11.560 --> 00:02:12.650
Banba?

00:02:13.180 --> 00:02:14.400
How?

00:02:14.400 --> 00:02:20.360
Enokida-kun told me that 
you might be in trouble.

00:02:20.360 --> 00:02:22.950
I told him to keep quiet.

00:02:22.950 --> 00:02:27.360
And I found you thanks to this.

00:02:29.360 --> 00:02:32.540
Do you think there's anything I can't do?

00:02:32.960 --> 00:02:34.830
That damn mushroom.

00:02:34.830 --> 00:02:36.560
Okay, let's go home.

00:02:37.070 --> 00:02:38.300
Want me to carry you?

00:02:38.720 --> 00:02:40.010
No.

00:02:40.010 --> 00:02:42.400
As stubborn as ever.

00:02:42.400 --> 00:02:43.730
It's not very cute—

00:02:48.770 --> 00:02:50.080
Banba!

00:02:50.860 --> 00:02:51.480
Banba!

00:02:52.320 --> 00:02:54.890
I'm really no good with guns.

00:02:54.890 --> 00:02:57.500
I was aiming for his leg.

00:02:57.500 --> 00:02:59.950
Feilang, you bastard!

00:02:59.950 --> 00:03:03.410
I said you couldn't escape from me.

00:03:03.770 --> 00:03:06.490
What's this guy to you?

00:03:06.490 --> 00:03:10.440
Don't tell me he's one of those people you "like."

00:03:10.440 --> 00:03:11.450
Stop!

00:03:12.590 --> 00:03:15.260
Hey, take him.

00:03:22.260 --> 00:03:24.510
Where are you taking him?!

00:03:26.300 --> 00:03:29.310
Don't worry. You're coming, too.

00:03:33.840 --> 00:03:35.400
Good evening.

00:03:35.810 --> 00:03:39.690
Enokida? This is awfully early for you, ain't it?

00:03:39.690 --> 00:03:40.860
True.

00:03:40.860 --> 00:03:42.130
Hello!

00:03:42.130 --> 00:03:43.240
Good evening.

00:03:43.240 --> 00:03:44.570
Hey!

00:03:44.570 --> 00:03:45.870
Pardon the intrusion.

00:03:45.870 --> 00:03:48.850
So you're all here at once?

00:03:48.850 --> 00:03:51.470
Are you plotting something?

00:03:51.470 --> 00:03:53.900
Well, something like that.

00:03:55.100 --> 00:03:57.880
Care to join us, Gen-san?

00:03:58.190 --> 00:04:01.510
Or should I say Jiji, the infamous hitman?

00:04:03.100 --> 00:04:06.600
I don't go by that name anymore.

00:04:11.010 --> 00:04:12.460
Damn.

00:04:13.920 --> 00:04:14.860
Banba!

00:04:16.060 --> 00:04:17.820
Hey, Banba!

00:04:19.090 --> 00:04:20.500
Ow...

00:04:20.500 --> 00:04:22.780
What are you yelling about?

00:04:24.610 --> 00:04:27.370
Oh, I thought you were dead.

00:04:27.370 --> 00:04:30.940
I would've been if they'd left me there.

00:04:31.560 --> 00:04:34.460
Looks like they patched me up.

00:04:34.860 --> 00:04:37.680
I think they hit me with a tranquilizer.

00:04:38.220 --> 00:04:40.000
My neck and ankle don't hurt.

00:04:40.510 --> 00:04:43.920
So they need us alive for now.

00:04:45.730 --> 00:04:48.260
Aren't you going to ask me any questions?

00:04:49.810 --> 00:04:50.970
You want me to?

00:04:50.970 --> 00:04:53.930
That's not what I mean.

00:04:54.480 --> 00:04:57.620
Just kidding! I'm dying to know!

00:04:57.620 --> 00:05:00.330
Tell me, tell me! I'll give 
you this in exchange.

00:05:01.370 --> 00:05:03.040
Candy?

00:05:03.680 --> 00:05:05.340
Fine.

00:05:08.700 --> 00:05:12.270
So who's that guy who shot me?

00:05:12.700 --> 00:05:13.770
That's Feilang.

00:05:14.210 --> 00:05:16.700
We grew up in the same facility.

00:05:17.440 --> 00:05:20.560
He was my best friend, partner, 
and the only person I could trust.

00:05:21.070 --> 00:05:24.160
But in the end, he betrayed me.

00:05:25.330 --> 00:05:27.940
When I remembered what he did to me,

00:05:27.940 --> 00:05:31.470
I thought things would turn 
out the same way again.

00:05:31.920 --> 00:05:34.590
So that's why you ran off?

00:05:34.590 --> 00:05:35.420
Yeah.

00:05:35.970 --> 00:05:37.770
Do you think I'm stupid?

00:05:37.770 --> 00:05:42.170
No, I've been betrayed by 
someone I trusted, too.

00:05:42.650 --> 00:05:44.170
I don't think you're stupid.

00:05:44.780 --> 00:05:45.900
But...

00:05:45.900 --> 00:05:52.120
I trust people who I want to trust.

00:05:53.100 --> 00:05:54.750
That keeps things interesting.

00:05:56.010 --> 00:05:59.040
If I were betrayed again...

00:06:01.370 --> 00:06:05.050
You've been angry, you've been hurt...

00:06:05.980 --> 00:06:08.470
But you'll trust again.

00:06:09.020 --> 00:06:14.760
After all, if you cut everyone from the team 
who makes an error, you'll never play baseball.

00:06:14.760 --> 00:06:16.880
More baseball talk?

00:06:16.880 --> 00:06:19.690
Are you saying I make too many errors?

00:06:20.160 --> 00:06:21.400
You caught on?

00:06:22.160 --> 00:06:26.000
Still, I trust you, Lin-chan.

00:06:26.510 --> 00:06:29.360
You just want to play baseball, moron Ban.

00:06:31.490 --> 00:06:36.190
But... I've started liking baseball lately.

00:06:39.210 --> 00:06:40.060
I see.

00:06:49.630 --> 00:06:52.460
Misaki-chan, let's use the "crying child" plan.

00:06:53.070 --> 00:06:55.860
A girl's tears are a weapon 
that works on anyone.

00:06:55.860 --> 00:06:57.950
Try not to get upset for real.

00:06:58.380 --> 00:06:59.230
Okay?

00:06:59.230 --> 00:07:01.330
I know.

00:07:03.130 --> 00:07:04.430
Let's go.

00:07:06.370 --> 00:07:09.610
For now, we need to find a way out of here.

00:07:10.590 --> 00:07:12.090
Are you listening?

00:07:13.150 --> 00:07:15.180
Yeah, I hear you.

00:07:15.180 --> 00:07:17.750
What's the plan?

00:07:17.750 --> 00:07:22.600
It looks like they've taken us to the 
Kakyu Association's headquarters.

00:07:23.010 --> 00:07:27.490
What is this place? 
It looks like an oversized cage.

00:07:27.950 --> 00:07:29.570
It's an execution room.

00:07:29.570 --> 00:07:30.720
An execution room?

00:07:31.100 --> 00:07:33.150
I've heard rumors about it.

00:07:33.730 --> 00:07:37.430
Chairman Wang built it to house a tiger.

00:07:37.810 --> 00:07:39.650
But after the tiger died,

00:07:39.650 --> 00:07:42.830
the room was used to execute anyone 
who opposed the association.

00:07:43.900 --> 00:07:45.610
A tiger cage, huh?

00:07:51.660 --> 00:07:54.060
The bad guy's making his entrance.

00:07:57.680 --> 00:08:00.910
Feilang, what are you going to do with us?

00:08:01.290 --> 00:08:04.350
Mao, I had them show me this.

00:08:04.350 --> 00:08:07.630
And we listened to your conversation.

00:08:07.630 --> 00:08:10.650
Are you seriously on a baseball team?

00:08:10.650 --> 00:08:12.660
A hitman like you?

00:08:12.660 --> 00:08:15.520
It helps me work off the stress.

00:08:15.520 --> 00:08:18.470
I don't want to end up all cranky like you.

00:08:20.380 --> 00:08:23.310
I should work off some stress, too, then.

00:08:37.690 --> 00:08:39.160
What are those for?

00:08:39.160 --> 00:08:41.650
You're slow on the uptake, Mao.

00:08:41.650 --> 00:08:43.120
We've done this before.

00:08:44.190 --> 00:08:45.540
You don't mean...

00:08:45.540 --> 00:08:48.960
The two of you will fight to the death.

00:08:49.680 --> 00:08:52.630
The survivor goes free.

00:08:52.630 --> 00:08:55.710
Now, grab a weapon!

00:09:02.060 --> 00:09:02.990
Banba...

00:09:08.650 --> 00:09:11.840
<i>You don't use bats for killing.</i>

00:09:13.150 --> 00:09:15.450
<i>I get it, Banba.</i>

00:09:20.950 --> 00:09:25.740
I warned them that you might try that.

00:09:25.740 --> 00:09:29.000
I've known you for five years, after all.

00:09:29.000 --> 00:09:32.490
If you really refuse to do it, 
we'll do this instead.

00:09:32.490 --> 00:09:38.200
I'll kidnap your baseball teammates 
and make them do the same thing.

00:09:38.200 --> 00:09:41.470
Until you kill someone.

00:09:41.920 --> 00:09:45.050
If you won't do it, I will.

00:09:45.820 --> 00:09:47.630
Starting with him.

00:09:47.630 --> 00:09:50.150
Don't! It's me you want!

00:09:50.150 --> 00:09:51.470
Shoot me!

00:09:52.240 --> 00:09:55.360
Lin, it's okay.

00:09:58.720 --> 00:10:00.320
<i>That's the sign for a hit and run.</i>

00:10:00.960 --> 00:10:03.410
You have to run, and put your 
faith in your teammates.

00:10:03.410 --> 00:10:05.580
Trust that they'll be able to handle it.

00:10:06.050 --> 00:10:09.380
<i>Okay, Banba, you'd better hit it.</i>

00:10:09.380 --> 00:10:11.200
<i>I'm putting my faith in you.</i>

00:10:23.200 --> 00:10:24.320
<i>I can hit him!</i>

00:10:25.810 --> 00:10:27.730
The heart next!

00:10:31.550 --> 00:10:32.360
Lin!

00:10:46.640 --> 00:10:49.830
<b>30 Minutes Earlier</b>

00:10:49.830 --> 00:10:53.880
Please. She needs to use your bathroom.

00:10:53.880 --> 00:10:55.920
Please, mister.

00:10:55.920 --> 00:10:57.260
Go away.

00:10:57.260 --> 00:10:59.630
This isn't that kind of establishment.

00:10:59.630 --> 00:11:02.470
But I can't hold it!

00:11:02.470 --> 00:11:03.790
Who cares?

00:11:03.790 --> 00:11:06.060
Just go take a piss wherever!

00:11:06.060 --> 00:11:07.770
Snap.

00:11:08.810 --> 00:11:12.380
Hold it. Are you telling 
her to embarrass herself?

00:11:12.380 --> 00:11:16.020
Or are you getting off on picturing it?

00:11:17.030 --> 00:11:19.870
Just let her use the bathroom!

00:11:19.870 --> 00:11:22.370
Don't underestimate the anger of a gay man!

00:11:24.320 --> 00:11:24.700
<b>Full</b>

00:11:24.320 --> 00:11:26.160
<b>Flush</b>

00:11:24.320 --> 00:11:26.160
<b>Half</b>

00:11:25.120 --> 00:11:26.160
<b>Full</b>

00:11:26.160 --> 00:11:27.980
Hey, hurry it up!

00:11:27.980 --> 00:11:30.750
I am. Don't rush me.

00:11:39.130 --> 00:11:42.740
The cute little spy has made it inside.

00:11:42.740 --> 00:11:44.000
Roger that.

00:11:44.000 --> 00:11:45.850
Leave the rest to us.

00:11:47.090 --> 00:11:49.280
Ready, Dr. Saeki?

00:11:49.280 --> 00:11:52.780
I've been using robot arms for surgery.

00:11:53.250 --> 00:11:56.060
This is nothing.

00:11:58.020 --> 00:12:00.690
Are you ready, Gen-san?

00:12:00.690 --> 00:12:01.950
Got a connection yet?

00:12:01.950 --> 00:12:02.880
Hold on.

00:12:03.680 --> 00:12:04.890
Hey, Banba...

00:12:04.890 --> 00:12:06.220
<i>Do you read me?</i>

00:12:07.210 --> 00:12:09.290
Yeah, I hear you.

00:12:09.630 --> 00:12:11.260
We got through.

00:12:11.260 --> 00:12:13.840
We've confirmed what building you're in.

00:12:13.840 --> 00:12:16.630
It's the Kakyu Association's HQ.

00:12:17.210 --> 00:12:21.970
It looks like they've taken us to the 
Kakyu Association's headquarters.

00:12:21.970 --> 00:12:24.790
<i>We can't pinpoint your location, though.</i>

00:12:24.790 --> 00:12:26.640
<i>What do you see?</i>

00:12:27.680 --> 00:12:32.400
What is this place? 
It looks like an oversized cage.

00:12:32.400 --> 00:12:33.700
<i>It's an execution room.</i>

00:12:33.700 --> 00:12:35.040
<i>An execution room?</i>

00:12:35.040 --> 00:12:36.540
I think I know where they are.

00:12:37.980 --> 00:12:39.740
I've heard about this place.

00:12:39.740 --> 00:12:42.540
The Kakyu Association's HQ building 
has an execution room.

00:12:42.540 --> 00:12:44.820
They used to keep a tiger in it.

00:12:45.730 --> 00:12:47.770
A tiger cage, huh?

00:12:47.770 --> 00:12:49.420
Sounds like you're right.

00:12:49.890 --> 00:12:55.810
Dr. Saeki, turn right in thirty meters, 
then go straight for twenty meters.

00:12:55.810 --> 00:12:57.000
Roger that.

00:13:02.260 --> 00:13:05.530
I'm in position. Whenever you're ready.

00:13:05.530 --> 00:13:06.970
The heart next!

00:13:09.330 --> 00:13:10.140
Time out!

00:13:10.760 --> 00:13:11.600
Lin!

00:13:12.930 --> 00:13:14.030
Three...

00:13:14.030 --> 00:13:14.980
Two...

00:13:14.980 --> 00:13:15.930
One...

00:13:16.900 --> 00:13:17.650
Boom!

00:13:34.410 --> 00:13:36.290
Feilang's gone.

00:13:42.850 --> 00:13:46.010
I won't let you kill him!

00:13:46.650 --> 00:13:50.970
He's the only one who can save Lee-san!

00:14:01.600 --> 00:14:04.200
Old man, why are you dressed like that?

00:14:04.200 --> 00:14:07.320
The infamous hitman Jiji is back.

00:14:08.110 --> 00:14:10.910
For a one-night-only comeback show.

00:14:11.330 --> 00:14:12.620
Here!

00:14:12.620 --> 00:14:16.190
I need you to be my foil, Niwaka Samurai!

00:14:16.190 --> 00:14:19.500
If you need me that badly, I'll join you.

00:14:19.500 --> 00:14:20.980
Whatever.

00:14:20.980 --> 00:14:22.010
This way!

00:14:21.460 --> 00:14:22.420
Hurry!

00:14:22.010 --> 00:14:23.370
Don't let them leave alive!

00:14:35.470 --> 00:14:37.160
He's going all-out.

00:14:37.160 --> 00:14:41.150
Banba... I'm going after Feilang.

00:14:41.150 --> 00:14:42.800
What for?

00:14:44.370 --> 00:14:45.770
I'll go for you.

00:14:46.910 --> 00:14:49.010
No, I'll go.

00:14:50.080 --> 00:14:51.550
Let me handle this.

00:14:54.270 --> 00:14:55.070
Okay.

00:14:55.870 --> 00:14:57.100
Have a safe trip.

00:14:58.610 --> 00:14:59.390
Yeah.

00:15:00.810 --> 00:15:01.790
I'm off.

00:15:06.780 --> 00:15:09.470
Guess it's time for me to get started.

00:15:11.300 --> 00:15:16.850
Now I'll find out where the 
executives are hiding.

00:15:16.850 --> 00:15:18.880
Keep watch, okay?

00:15:18.880 --> 00:15:20.930
I'm weak, after all.

00:15:20.930 --> 00:15:24.450
Damn. I thought I'd get to cause a ruckus.

00:15:26.570 --> 00:15:28.540
What are you doing over there?!

00:15:29.420 --> 00:15:32.280
Yes, what, indeed?

00:15:35.580 --> 00:15:38.700
Can't he be a little quieter?

00:15:52.650 --> 00:15:54.400
Was that it?

00:15:54.400 --> 00:15:57.140
They had superior numbers, 
but they were pushovers.

00:15:57.140 --> 00:15:59.120
What's all this?

00:15:59.980 --> 00:16:02.190
Someone's here to complicate things.

00:16:02.190 --> 00:16:04.490
I didn't come to see you.

00:16:05.260 --> 00:16:07.360
Where's the red-headed hitman?

00:16:08.700 --> 00:16:09.970
Never mind.

00:16:09.970 --> 00:16:11.310
I'll find him myself.

00:16:11.900 --> 00:16:14.870
I can't let you have him.

00:16:14.870 --> 00:16:18.910
Lin-chan has to settle the score on his own.

00:16:18.910 --> 00:16:21.860
Oh, you're gonna get in my way?

00:16:21.860 --> 00:16:26.080
If you insist on going after him, 
you'll have to beat me first.

00:16:26.540 --> 00:16:27.970
I get it.

00:16:28.490 --> 00:16:31.720
I'd be glad to take you up on that, but...

00:16:33.170 --> 00:16:35.850
Do you think you're in any 
condition to fight me?

00:16:35.850 --> 00:16:37.760
You must not think much of me.

00:16:43.520 --> 00:16:47.060
I'll do what you say for today.

00:16:47.060 --> 00:16:49.490
I'll save what I was going to 
do to the redhead for you.

00:16:51.690 --> 00:16:55.090
I guess you've been working on your control.

00:16:55.090 --> 00:16:59.250
Of course. I'll strike you 
out in three pitches.

00:17:03.870 --> 00:17:05.440
Welcome back.

00:17:05.440 --> 00:17:06.940
Did you kill the redhead?

00:17:06.940 --> 00:17:09.840
No, but I'm done with that.

00:17:11.500 --> 00:17:12.420
So...

00:17:12.420 --> 00:17:16.630
Yeah, let's go home to Kokura.

00:17:22.560 --> 00:17:25.270
The tranquilizer's wearing off.

00:17:25.790 --> 00:17:28.480
The exhaustion is worse than I thought.

00:17:58.380 --> 00:17:59.970
Hey, Mao.

00:17:59.970 --> 00:18:01.760
My guts hurt.

00:18:02.940 --> 00:18:08.270
You're good, having aim like
that in the middle of a fight.

00:18:08.270 --> 00:18:11.440
You were good at sharpshooting 
in the factory, too.

00:18:11.440 --> 00:18:16.010
You were better than me at 
hand-to-hand combat, like boxing.

00:18:16.010 --> 00:18:17.490
Better at English, too.

00:18:18.410 --> 00:18:21.210
And you were better at Japanese.

00:18:22.050 --> 00:18:25.660
See? We'd make a great team.

00:18:26.130 --> 00:18:28.220
Let's work together.

00:18:28.220 --> 00:18:32.540
Working together, we'd have nothing to fear!

00:18:32.850 --> 00:18:36.130
No, I won't work with you.

00:18:36.460 --> 00:18:39.090
You like this city that much?

00:18:39.820 --> 00:18:43.070
Yeah. I want to live here.

00:18:43.530 --> 00:18:50.060
I want to play baseball, eat tonkotsu ramen, 
and talk about idiotic things with idiots.

00:18:50.510 --> 00:18:55.650
But if you want to destroy that, I'll...

00:18:55.650 --> 00:18:57.220
You can't—

00:18:57.220 --> 00:18:58.320
I <i>can </i>kill you!

00:18:59.690 --> 00:19:03.200
I'm not that child anymore.

00:19:34.380 --> 00:19:37.820
It's no use. You won't reach the knife.

00:19:38.130 --> 00:19:41.180
I know the state of this playing field.

00:19:44.570 --> 00:19:46.590
This time, I'll make sure I kill you.

00:19:47.930 --> 00:19:50.910
Goodbye, Fei.

00:19:55.810 --> 00:20:02.130
Mao, you've always had 
what I could never have.

00:20:03.310 --> 00:20:08.590
I've always been... jealous...

00:20:20.820 --> 00:20:24.700
Those guys sure made a mess.

00:20:24.700 --> 00:20:28.030
Don't they know I have to clean up after them?

00:21:01.500 --> 00:21:04.110
Welcome back, Lin-chan.

00:21:05.470 --> 00:21:06.570
Yeah.

00:21:08.170 --> 00:21:09.530
Welcome back!

00:21:14.300 --> 00:21:15.520
I'm back.

00:21:19.340 --> 00:21:20.800
Kokura 
Fried Udons

00:21:19.340 --> 00:21:20.800
Hakata 
Tonkotsu Ramens

00:21:19.340 --> 00:21:20.800
Strike!

00:21:20.800 --> 00:21:23.260
Sarucchi, one more!

00:21:24.560 --> 00:21:26.690
Yeah, I know!

00:21:26.690 --> 00:21:27.890
Get ready.

00:21:28.770 --> 00:21:30.100
Sure, sure.

00:21:30.100 --> 00:21:33.130
Two outs in the bottom of 
the ninth with bases loaded.

00:21:33.130 --> 00:21:36.810
Please, Banba-san! We just need one run!

00:21:36.810 --> 00:21:41.020
Nah, he'll go for the win.

00:21:41.020 --> 00:21:42.270
I think you're right.

00:21:42.270 --> 00:21:44.740
Those two have a connection, after all.

00:21:44.740 --> 00:21:46.960
Saru, finish him off!

00:21:46.960 --> 00:21:50.160
Just do something, Banba-san!

00:21:50.160 --> 00:21:54.620
Banba, if you don't get a hit, you're not 
getting spicy pollock roe for a week!

00:21:54.620 --> 00:21:56.830
I wouldn't want that.

00:21:56.830 --> 00:21:59.460
I don't feel like me without 
my spicy pollock roe.

00:22:00.350 --> 00:22:02.920
I'll strike you out in three pitches!

00:22:03.520 --> 00:22:05.740
This one's going straight into the stands!
